return {h=15,w=540,cr=45,hc=25,bh=70,gr="slow",eg={"bug"},st={80,125,75,40,95,85},ab={{68,0},{62,0},{153,1}},genus={en="Single Horn Pokémon",es="Pokémon Cuerno",pt="Pokémon Chifre Único"},flavor={en={[4]="This powerful Pokémon thrusts its prized horn under its enemies’ bellies then lifts and throws them.",[5]="Usually docile, but if disturbed while sipping honey, it chases off the intruder with its horn.",[6]="With its Herculean powers, it can easily throw arou nd an object that is 100 times its own weight.",[7]="HERACROSS charges in a straight line at its foe, slips beneath the foe’s grasp, and then scoops up and hurls the opponent with its mighty horn. This Pokémon even has enough power to topple a massive tree.",[8]="HERACROSS has sharp claws on its feet. These are planted firmly into the ground or the bark of a tree, giving the Pokémon a secure and solid footing to forcefully fling away foes with its proud horn.",[9]="They gather in forests seeking the sweet sap of trees. It is completely clad in a steel-hard shell. It is proud of its horn, which it uses to fling foes.",[10]="Usually docile, but if disturbed while sipping honey, it chases off the intruder with its horn.",[11]="This powerful Pokémon thrusts its prized horn under its enemies’ bellies, then lifts and throws them.",[12]="It gathers in forests to search for tree sap, its favorite food. It’s strong enough to hurl foes.",[13]="With powerful legs and claws, it generates enough power to hurl foes over great distances.",[14]="It loves sweet honey. To keep all the honey to itself, it hurls rivals away with its prized horn.",[15]="This powerful Pokémon thrusts its prized horn under its enemies’ bellies, then lifts and throws them.",[16]="It is usually docile, but if it is disturbed while sipping honey, it chases off the intruder with its horn.",[17]="It loves sweet honey. To keep all the honey to itself, it hurls rivals away with its prized horn.",[18]="It loves sweet honey. To keep all the honey to itself, it hurls rivals away with its prized horn.",[21]="No matter how heavy its opponents, it flings them far away with its prized horn.",[22]="No matter how heavy its opponents, it flings them far away with its prized horn.",[23]="This powerful Pokémon thrusts its prized horn under its enemies’ bellies, then lifts and throws them.",[24]="With its Herculean powers, it can easily throw around an object that is 100 times its own weight.",[25]="Heracross charges in a straight line at its foe, slips beneath the foe’s grasp, and then scoops up and hurls the opponent with its mighty horn. This Pokémon even has enough power to topple a massive tree.",[26]="Heracross has sharp claws on its feet. These are planted firmly into the ground or the bark of a tree, giving the Pokémon a secure and solid footing to forcefully fling away foes with its proud horn.",[29]="It’s proud of its thick horn. In Alola, its biggest rival is Vikavolt, which it’s always fighting with.",[30]="It roams through forests searching for sweet nectar. Although it boasts fantastic physical strength, it’s not that good at flying.",[33]="Heracross loves sweet sap and will go looking through forests for it. The Pokémon uses its two antennae to pick up scents as it searches.",[34]="This Pokémon takes pride in its strength, which allows it to lift things 100 times heavier than itself with no trouble at all.",[39]="This Pokémon has an unparalleled horn. Heracross itself demonstrates tremendous power, it's capable of throwing several people trained in the traditional arts of war at once."},es={[23]="Este fuerte Pokémon clava su preciado cuerno en la tripa del enemigo, lo eleva y luego lo arroja.",[24]="Tiene una fuerza descomunal. Puede, sin gran esfuerzo, arrojar objetos que superen su peso en cien veces.",[25]="Heracross carga en línea recta contra el enemigo, se le queda encajado por debajo, lo agarra y lo lanza con ayuda del fuerte cuerno que tiene. Este Pokémon tiene fuerza hasta para echar abajo un árbol descomunal.",[26]="Heracross tiene unas afiladas garras en los pies que se clavan con firmeza en la tierra o la corteza de los árboles, dando al Pokémon gran estabilidad y seguridad a la hora de embestir y herir a su rival con el cuerno que tiene.",[29]="Luce con orgullo su gran cornamenta. Los Vikavolt son sus mayores rivales en Alola y tienen enfrentamientos constantes.",[30]="Ronda los bosques en busca de miel. Se jacta de su fuerza, pero su capacidad de vuelo deja mucho que desear.",[33]="Adora la savia dulce de los árboles. Recorre el bosque en su busca y se sirve de las antenas para detectar su olor.",[34]="Este Pokémon muestra una fuerza hercúlea, que le permite levantar cien veces su propio peso sin inmutarse."},pt="Este Pokémon tem um chifre sem igual. O próprio Heracross demonstra uma força tremenda: é capaz de arremessar de uma só vez várias pessoas treinadas nas artes marciais tradicionais."},evo={{s=214}},moves={[3]={1,33,1,43,6,30,12,203,19,31,27,68,35,36,44,179,54,224},[4]={1,33,1,43,6,30,12,203,19,31,27,68,35,36,44,179,54,224},[5]={1,33,1,43,6,30,11,203,17,31,23,280,30,68,37,36,45,179,53,224},[6]={1,33,1,43,6,30,11,203,17,31,23,280,30,68,37,36,45,179,53,224},[7]={1,33,1,43,6,30,11,203,17,31,23,280,30,68,37,36,45,179,53,224},[8]={1,400,1,33,1,43,1,30,1,203,7,31,13,332,19,280,25,68,31,36,37,370,43,179,49,364,55,224},[9]={1,400,1,33,1,43,1,30,1,203,7,31,13,332,19,280,25,68,31,36,37,370,43,179,49,364,55,224},[10]={1,400,1,33,1,43,1,30,1,203,7,31,13,332,19,280,25,68,31,36,37,370,43,179,49,364,55,224},[11]={1,400,1,33,1,43,1,30,1,203,7,31,13,332,19,280,25,68,31,36,37,370,43,179,49,364,55,224},[12]={1,33,1,43,6,30,11,203,17,31,23,280,30,68,37,36,45,179,53,224},[13]={1,33,1,43,6,30,11,203,17,31,23,280,30,68,37,36,45,179,53,224},[14]={1,400,1,33,1,43,1,30,1,203,7,31,10,332,16,498,19,68,25,280,28,36,34,370,37,364,43,179,46,224},[15]={1,292,1,331,1,400,1,33,1,43,1,30,1,203,7,31,10,332,16,498,19,68,25,280,28,36,31,42,34,370,37,364,43,179,46,224},[16]={1,292,1,331,1,40